{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"『Fate/Grand Order（FGO）』ビーストが必ず獲得できる「ビーストオーダー召喚」開催。人類悪確定ガチャ\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fate-grand-order-20260812-457992-header.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>『Fate/Grand Order（FGO）』の11周年を記念して、聖晶石30個で人類悪が確定入手できるガチャ「ビーストオーダー召喚」が開催された。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/fate-grand-order-20260812-457992/","timestamp":"2026-08-02T09:12:59Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
